# Ampel: the traffic light on the kerb at the side street's mouth (D-093).
# A k-outlined d housing (m lit left edge) with three round lamps (top red,
# middle amber, bottom green) under k visors on an m/d pole with a base
# plate. A lit lamp is bright (p/r, c/Y, y/g + w glint) with a 1 px glow
# ring (R, o, G); unlit lamps are dark k discs with an m reflection.
# rotgelb = red and amber together (the telegraph). gruen_blink = green on
# / off (the four Austrian blinks). No pedestrian light (keeps the lit lamp
# the only information at 1x). Faces the viewer, no mirror.
sprite = ampel
size   = 16x48
origin = 8,48
anim   = rot         frames=1
anim   = rotgelb     frames=1
anim   = gruen       frames=1
anim   = gruen_blink frames=2 ticks=8 loop
anim   = gelb        frames=1
---
